  "profileAboutApp": "About FortuneBoot",
  "profileAppVersion": "App version",
  "profileApiVersion": "API version",
  "profileIcp": "ICP filing",
  "profileHelpContent": "FortuneBoot is a multi-group, multi-book expense tracker.\n\n· Quickly add a record on the home page, or view details on the bills page.\n· Open \"Mine\" to manage categories, tags, accounts, members, and more.\n· If you run into problems, contact your admin or check the project docs.",
  "profileHelpIntro": "FortuneBoot is a collaborative expense tracker with multiple groups and books. The sections below explain the common features to get you started.",
  "profileHelpQuickTitle": "Quick entry",
  "profileHelpQuickBody": "Tap the blue \"+\" button in the center of the bottom bar to add a record. Enter a title, then pick a category and amount. Switch between expense, income, transfer, advance and reimbursement at the top. You can split across multiple categories, add fees/discounts, and attach receipt photos.",
  "profileHelpBillsTitle": "Bills & billing cycle",
  "profileHelpBillsBody": "The bills page groups records by billing cycle. Use the arrows at the top to move between adjacent cycles; scrolling down loads older bills automatically. Set a custom cycle start day under \"Mine → Month start day\" (e.g. the 5th) to match your payday.",
  "profileHelpBookTitle": "Groups & books",
  "profileHelpBookBody": "Groups isolate scenarios (personal, family, company), and each group can hold multiple books. Add, edit, set default or disable them under \"Mine → Group / Book management\". Switching the current book refreshes bills, stats and accounts.",
  "profileHelpManageTitle": "Base data management",
  "profileHelpManageBody": "Categories, tags, payees, members and accounts are each managed separately. Categories and tags support tree hierarchies; accounts cover cash, credit card, asset and loan types and roll up net worth. Disabled or deleted items go to the recycle bin and can be restored.",
  "profileHelpRecurringTitle": "Recurring bills",
  "profileHelpRecurringBody": "Create automatic rules under \"Mine → Recurring\". Use the visual frequency picker (daily/weekly/monthly/yearly) to generate a rule without writing cron; advanced users can switch to custom mode and edit the cron expression directly.",
  "profileHelpPrivacyTitle": "Privacy & display",
  "profileHelpPrivacyBody": "Turn on \"Hide amounts\" to mask figures on the home and bills pages for public viewing. You can also customize income/expense colors and switch between light and dark themes.",
  "profileHelpContactTitle": "Getting help",
  "profileHelpContactBody": "If you hit data issues or have questions, try pull-to-refresh or re-login first. If that doesn't help, contact your group admin or visit the project home page for docs and feedback.",
  "profileDonateContent": "Thanks for your support!\nIf you'd like to sponsor development, find donation options on the project home page.",
  "profileLogoutConfirm": "Are you sure you want to log out?",
